{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>食環署解釋食肆准狗隻進入安排　指狗隻便溺須由餐廳負責清理　脫下狗帶不勸喻或違法</strong></p><p>・食環署解釋食肆准狗隻進入安排　指狗隻便溺須由餐廳負責清理　脫下狗帶不勸喻或違法</p><p>暫時未能從明報 本地擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://news.mingpao.com/ins/%e6%b8%af%e8%81%9e/article/20260511/s00001/1778500653608/%e9%a3%9f%e7%92%b0%e7%bd%b2%e8%a7%a3%e9%87%8b%e9%a3%9f%e8%82%86%e5%87%86%e7%8b%97%e9%9a%bb%e9%80%b2%e5%85%a5%e5%ae%89%e6%8e%92-%e6%8c%87%e7%8b%97%e9%9a%bb%e4%be%bf%e6%ba%ba%e9%a0%88%e7%94%b1%e9%a4%90%e5%bb%b3%e8%b2%a0%e8%b2%ac%e6%b8%85%e7%90%86-%e8%84%ab%e4%b8%8b%e7%8b%97%e5%b8%b6%e4%b8%8d%e5%8b%b8%e5%96%bb%e6%88%96%e9%81%95%e6%b3%95\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T04:19:22.103816+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":101,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"minimal"}}